sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Aluno externo
  participant FE as Portal Boost
  participant G as BoostJwtAuthGuard
  participant CTRL as BoostPortalController
  participant SVC as BoostPortalService
  participant CERT as CertificadoBoostService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  A->>FE: marca ultima aula como concluida
  FE->>G: PATCH /boost/aulas/:id/concluir + token tipo=boost
  G->>G: verifica token contra boost_usuarios
  G->>CTRL: autorizado
  CTRL->>SVC: concluirAula(aulaId, boostUsuarioId)
  SVC->>SVC: exigirMatriculaDaAula()
  SVC->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  SVC->>DB: cria ProgressoAula
  SVC->>DB: recalcula progressoPct da matricula
  alt progressoPct = 100 e curso emite certificado
    SVC->>DB: matricula status = concluida
    SVC->>CERT: gerar(matricula)
    CERT->>CERT: monta PDF com pdfkit
    CERT->>DB: cria CertificadoBoost (codigo unico)
  end
  SVC->>DB: COMMIT
  SVC-->>FE: 200 { progressoPct, certificado }
  FE-->>A: certificado disponivel para download
